Production URL: https://api.delbank.com.br
:---------------

When you're ready to access the production environment, you can use the following as an example on what you need for the production API. The production API requires that the mTLS certificate, the private key and the API key are set up correctly. It also requires your static public outbound (egress) IPs to be allowlisted (required from February/2026 onward). You can use the example and change up as needed, depending on the type of HTTP request methods and the endpoint you're trying to reach



| Key              |                      Description                      |
| :--------------- | :---------------------------------------------------: |
| mTLS certificate |     The mTLS certificate our team sent (.pem file)    |
| Private Key      | The private key that was generated along with the csr |
| API key          |               The API key our team sent               |
| Account id       | The account number linked to the API key              |
| Static egress IP(s) | Fixed public outbound IP(s) shared in advance for production allowlist |


